  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRHR Policy - Konsult Brolin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRHR Policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I regleringsbrevet f&#xf6;r 2004 har Sida givits i uppdrag att senast 30 april 2005 l&#xe4;mna et bidrag till svensk policy f&#xf6;r arbete med SRHR utifr&#xe5;n ett utvecklinsperspektiv. Detta arbete drivs i projektform.Stor vikt kommer att l&#xe4;ggas p&#xe5; att arbetet ska involvera s&#xe5; m&#xe5;nga aktorer som m&#xf6;jligt inklusive ungdomar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The letter of appropriation for 2004 commissions Sida to elaborate a contribution to a policy on SRHR f&#xf6;r the Swedish development cooperation. The Policy shall be finalised by 30 April 2005. The work will be carried out as a Project with as much participation as possible for internal and extarnal actors, in particular youth.</narrative>
  </description>
